### Manual API requests.
###
### Works with the REST Client extension in VS Code, or JetBrains' built-in
### HTTP client. Committed to the repo so the requests live alongside the code
### and change with it -- unlike a Postman collection sitting in someone's
### account.
###
### Automated tests live in test/e2e/. This file is for poking at things by hand.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@contentType = application/json

### Health check
GET http://localhost:8080/health

### Create a todo
# @name createTodo
POST {{baseUrl}}/todos
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Learn Go interfaces",
  "description": "Specifically implicit satisfaction and the empty interface",
  "due_date": "2026-10-01T12:00:00Z"
}

### Capture the id from the response above
@todoId = {{createTodo.response.body.id}}

### List all todos
GET {{baseUrl}}/todos

### List only completed
GET {{baseUrl}}/todos?completed=true

### List overdue, paginated
GET {{baseUrl}}/todos?overdue=true&limit=10&offset=0

### Get one todo
GET {{baseUrl}}/todos/{{todoId}}

### Update a todo
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/todos/{{todoId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "title": "Learn Go interfaces properly"
}

### Complete it
POST {{baseUrl}}/todos/{{todoId}}/complete

### Reopen it
POST {{baseUrl}}/todos/{{todoId}}/reopen

### Delete it
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/todos/{{todoId}}

### --- Error cases, worth checking by hand ---

### Empty title -> expect 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/todos
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{ "title": "" }

### Malformed JSON -> expect 400, never 500
POST {{baseUrl}}/todos
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{ "title":

### Unknown id -> expect 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/todos/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Malformed id -> expect 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/todos/not-a-uuid
